et at the rear of the main floor, with a brick fireplace, & access to the private rear deck in the treed yard.  The top floor enjoys 2 large bedrooms at the front of the home, & 2 more bedroom/office spaces at the rear, with their own staircase access.  Downstairs, a rec room with a wood stove, 5th bedroom, storage room & upgraded utility room serve the needs of any busy lifestyle.  A front drive to the heated garage with 220V power is great, & a double carport off the rear lane provides additional covered, snow-free car or RV parking.  Upgrades to shingles, windows, sewer line, & more, all on a quiet, tree-lined street in a fantastic location. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$574,900"],["Type","House"],["Bedrooms","7"],["Bathrooms","2"],["Living area","2,168 sq ft"],["Lot size","6,370 sq ft"],["Year built","1982"],["Storeys","2"],["Neighbourhood","North Glenora"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T5M1P6"],["MLS® number","E4503076"],["Listed","August 10, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Storage Shed, Window Coverings, Garage door opener"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Fireplace","Wood"],["Basement","Finished, Full"],["Parking","Detached Garage, Carport, RV, Oversize, Heated Garage"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","5.10 m × 3.50 m (16'9\" × 11'6\")"],["Dining room","Main level","4.10 m × 3.70 m (13'5\" × 12'2\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","4.40 m × 2.60 m (14'5\" × 8'6\")"],["Family room","Main level","4.90 m × 3.80 m (16'1\" × 12'6\")"],["Den","Upper Level","2.80 m × 2.30 m (9'2\" × 7'7\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Upper Level","4.30 m × 3.40 m (14'1\" × 11'2\")"],["Bedroom 2","Upper Level","2.90 m × 2.60 m (9'6\" × 8'6\")"],["Bedroom 3","Upper Level","3.20 m × 2.60 m (10'6\" × 8'6\")"],["Bedroom 4","Upper Level","4.00 m × 3.70 m (13'1\" × 12'2\")"],["Recreation room","Lower level","8.90 m × 3.50 m (29'2\" × 11'6\")"],["Bedroom 5","Upper Level","2.80 m × 2.30 m (9'2\" × 7'7\")"],["Bedroom 6","Lower level","2.50 m × 3